Package: thunar-disk-usage-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: thunar, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Enhances: thunar
Description: disk usage chart for the Thunar file manager
 Shows how much space a folder and its sub folders use, as a ring chart
 like the one of Baobab (GNOME Disk Usage Analyzer), right in Thunar:
  - a "Disk Usage" tab in the properties of a folder;
  - "Show Disk Usage" in the context menu of a folder (Ctrl+Alt+U) opens
    the same chart in a window of its own.
 .
 Click a ring segment to go into a folder, the centre to go back up.
 The scan does not cross into other file systems and counts hard links
 once, like "du -x".
